- Equation label "U = −pE cos θ" at (50,44), 13 px, colour `#7D3C98`.

### s1-nonuniform.svg  viewBox 0 0 260 190
Dipole in a field that is stronger at the positive end.
- Dipole axis from (90,110) to (170,110), ink colour, width 2.
