- Caption (not in SVG).

### s2-averaging-sphere.svg  viewBox 0 0 260 200
Averaging sphere for the macroscopic field (§4.2.3, background).
- Dashed circle centre (130,100) r 60, stroke `#7F8C8D`, fill `#EAF2F8` at 60% opacity.
